  "question": {
    "text": "The electric field of an electromagnetic wave in free space is $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{E}}=57 \\cos \\left[7.5 \\times 10^6 \\mathrm{t}-5 \\times 10^{-3}(3 x+4 y)\\right](4 \\hat{i}-3 \\hat{j}) N / C$.\nThe associated magnetic field in Tesla is"
